clue_text = "The key of the island chapel, labelled 'Chapel'. The Sisters gave it to Agnes, so she could always come to Margaret."
hint_text = "Agnes's sea chest stands on the floor right of the lens. It is locked with a tiny key; look for one tied to something holy."
